{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0074","paragraphs":[{"id":"p53f23aa0618c-1","text":"不信芳春厌老人。"},{"id":"p6f3d5aeb1edd-1","text":"老人几度送春归。"},{"id":"pb40a0e6a0d4e-1","text":"惜春行乐莫辞频。"},{"id":"p5c03bc23b7a5-1","text":"巧笑艳歌皆我意，恼花颠酒拼君嗔。"},{"id":"p4191646379cb-1","text":"物情惟有醉中真。"}]}